          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">CABIN/COMPOSITE PANEL</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">25mm top+bottom | corrugated outer</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Aerospace & Drone FAQs</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Why honeycomb cardboard for drone and aerospace shipments?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Vibration absorption like foam, weight savings vs foam, fully recyclable. Industry-standard packaging media globally.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Can honeycomb meet aerospace export requirements?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — meets ISTA-3A standards. Confirm with your forwarder for DG shipments specifically.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">What thickness for a foldable drone airframe?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">25mm for consumer drones; 40mm for commercial-class with extended booms.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Do you supply small batches for drone startups?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — combine honeycomb, cartons, foam, and ESD bags into a single RM 1,000+ order.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Can you custom-cut honeycomb to airframe geometry?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — CNC-cut to dimensioned drawings, 7–10 day lead time.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12 bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-lg p-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Packaging for Malaysia's Aerospace & UAV Industry</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">From Subang MRO to Cyberjaya drone makers — Quinocycle supplies the honeycomb packaging that protects flight-critical hardware in transit. Custom cuts, fast turnaround.</p>
