      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Conclusion: Aerospace-Grade Protection, Cardboard Economics</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-4">Honeycomb cardboard delivers foam-equivalent vibration protection at a fraction of the weight and zero of the disposal headache. For Malaysia's aerospace and drone sector, it's the right default.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">Talk to Quinocycle about your next aerospace or UAV shipment.</p>
